:: Fishing Forest Lake Catch
<<set _canEatFish to canEatFishTf($fishingHookedFish)>>

<<if _canEatFish>>
	아주 작은 물고기라, 한입에 다 넣을 수도 있을 것 같다.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name + " 보관하기"|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>>
	<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
	<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
	<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish.type)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
	<<endevent>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
<<if _canEatFish>>
	<br>
	<<link [[물고기를 먹는다|Fishing Forest Lake Cat Eat]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Cut
<<effects>>
당신은 낚싯줄을 <span class="purple">끊어버렸고</span>, <<= setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name>>【은는】 깊은 물 속으로 헤엄쳐 도망간다.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "cut">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[미끼를 꿰어 낚싯줄을 던진다 (0:03)|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[떠난다|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Snapped
낚싯줄이 팽팽해지더니, 이내 <span class="red">끊어진다.</span> <<= setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name>>【은는】 사라졌다.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "lineSnapped">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[미끼를 꿰어 낚싯줄을 던진다 (0:03)|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[떠난다|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Fish Too Far
<<= setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name>>【이가】 낚싯줄 끝까지 도달해 바늘을 풀고 <span class="red">도망쳤다</span>.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "fishOffHook">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[미끼를 꿰어 낚싯줄을 던진다 (0:03)|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[떠난다|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Pulled In
<<= setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name>>【이가】 더 세게 당긴다. 젖은 바위에서 발이 <span class="red">미끄러져</span> 호수 안으로 끌려 들어가지만, 물속으로 빠지는 와중에도 낚싯대는 꼭 쥐고 있다.<<gstress>><<stress 4>>
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "pulledIn">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[다음|Lake Depths]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
